const ROLEREQ=[["Platform engineer",[["ia",2],["cf",1]],"Platform team"],["Data engineer",[["dm",2],["tx",1]],"Data team"],["Search engineer (Lumen)",[["si",3]],"Lumen (vendor)"],["Operations engineer",[["cf",2],["ir",2]],"Ops team"],["Standards editor",[["er",3],["tx",1]],"Editors"],["Architect",[["sa",2],["dm",2]],"Architecture"],["Project manager",[["pm",3]],"PMO"]];
